{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ta77agvXrd1795778578.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>超級工商盃國際籃球邀請賽，今屆有9隊參加，下月在灣仔伊館上演。</p><p></p><p>這日進行抽籤儀式，滿貫教練梁民熊抽入A組，與香港東方、澳門昊駿爭出線，B隊有康仁福建，以及來自美國的洛杉磯睡熊貓、廣州商學院虎鯊，南華教練羅意庭就抽入C組，會與永倫上演「紅黃大戰」，台灣啤酒籃球隊加入戰團。</p><p></p><p>賽事12月15日展開，決賽20日舉行。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:24:15.511149+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T11:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T03:57:24.070888+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:17:25.374214+00:00","content_hash":"63f4c3822790badc87f1fb10b0b42a052ca37a85896118ba06367cf572c767c0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:24:15.511149+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}